  "solution": "**Given: **\n\nA = (1)/(2)+(1)/(3)times(1)/(4)div(1)/(5)-(1)/(6)\n\nB = (1)/(2)div(1)/(3)times(1)/(4)+(1)/(5)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nA = (1)/(2)+(1)/(3)times(1)/(4)div(1)/(5)-(1)/(6)\n\n⇒ (1)/(2)+(1)/(3)times(1)/(4)times{5}-(1)/(6)\n\n⇒ (1)/(2)+(5)/(12)-(1)/(6)\n\n⇒ (6+5-2)/(12)\n\n⇒ (9)/(12)\n\n⇒ (3)/(4)\n\nB = (1)/(2)div(1)/(3)times(1)/(4)+(1)/(5)\n\n⇒ (1)/(2)×3times(1)/(4)+(1)/(5)\n\n⇒ (3)/(8)+(1)/(5)\n\n⇒ (15+8)/(40)\n\n⇒ (23)/(40)\n\nNow,\n\nA - B = (3)/(4) - (23)/(40)\n\n⇒ (30 - 23)/(40)\n\n⇒ (7)/(40)\n\n**∴ The required answer is (7)/(40).**",
